# Iron Man, Master of Machines: "+1/+0 for each other artifact you control" and "Whenever Iron Man attacks, if an artifact
# entered the battlefield under your control this turn, draw a card." Turn 1 Bot1 casts four Moxes and Iron Man: 1/4 plus 4
# is 5/4 (Bot2's Mox, cast in turn 2, does not count; nor does Iron Man himself). Turn 3 he attacks with no artifact entered
# this turn - Bot2 flashes in a Lodestone Needle first and Bot1 destroys it with Abrade, but it is not his: no card (hand 2). Turn 5 Bot1 casts Mox Emerald (6/4) and destroys it with Abrade, then attacks: it entered
# this turn though it has left, so he draws (hand 2 again, from 1 before the draw).

